<title>USA: RYKA names Kate Bednarski as president.</title>
<headline>RYKA names Kate Bednarski as president.</headline>
<dateline>KING OF PRUSSIA, Pa 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>RYKA Inc on Monday said Kate Bednarski has been named president of the company, replacing Dennis DiDominicis.</p>
<p>DiDominicis will concentrate on his position as vice president of the firm's Branded Division.</p>
<p>Bednarski was vice president of global marketing for Avia Group International Inc, a unit of Reebok International Inc, before it was sold in June 1996 to American Sporting Goods Corp.</p>
<p>RYKA designs, develops and markets athletic footwear for women.</p>
</text>
